# ART-ALL01 -- W3-FIX-A acceptance: ALL01 (URBAN, New York). The Statue of
# Liberty (CANEWY04, isogen.mix cgnewy04.shp, art Palette=lib -> liburb.pal)
# draws green on its plinth; the invisible light posts (IN*LMP, NEGLAMP) are
# not drawn; every live building has art.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL01T.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat reveal
cheat art_dump
assert bld.5.CANEWY04 >= 1
assert art.missing == 0
assert art.invisible >= 10
cheat view_building CANEWY04
wait 2
shot statue
cheat view_building INYELWLAMP
wait 2
shot lamps
